  "reason": "QW-N59-4 hardened split: Q-seat bank child of native59 (8 x 167.4 x 76.14 SRAMs, two N-S stacks of 4 abutted at the 76.176 um track-legal pitch (0.036 um gap, no pins on the touching faces); column 0 mirrored MY so both columns' rd_out faces the 91.8 um middle gather channel, write faces outward); sits in the S part of the 518.4 x 648 native59 slot under the service child | QW-N59-6 v8: N-face pins 131.2-392.0 and S-face pins 131.2-~277 um (same outline, same faces, same order); parent lp.py regen adopts the child pins (top-down pin assignment)",
